EIID_Recon_V7
EIID_Recon_V8
EIID_Recon_V9
EIID_Recon_V10
grid_resampler
geant4_simulator
doppler_experiment
doppler_compare
doppler_sample_generator
response_calibrator
kernel_benchmark
efficiency_simulator
efficiency_merge
efficiency_preflight

# 测试程序本体；保留旁边的 .cpp、.h 和 JSON 测试用例。
**/common/tests/test_absolute_efficiency
**/Geant4_Simulation/tests/test_absolute_efficiency_estimator
**/Reconstruction/tests/test_efficiency_weighted_mlem
**/Reconstruction/tests/test_pixel_integrated_response
